# P0 / P1 / P2 pretrainings of small_RC: SAINT-small, column + row steps (encoder rowcol_concat_v1_small, depth 2)
# (rriva, 2026-11-26).  The model is the base config: CONFIG=saint_small_RC.
# Same recipe for every model of this experiment:
#   40 epochs, batch 12800, AdamW lr 1e-3, gradient clip 1.0 (arm=pretrain), contrastive T 0.1, noise lambda 0.4,
#   no dropout; WSD: warmup 2 epochs, constant, decay over epochs 32-40; no early stopping, downstream loads last.ckpt.
#   p0 = per-object contrastive on the track and jet-feature embeddings (the aggregator is not trained)
#   p1 = p0 + jet contrastive (weight 1.0, T 0.1) on the aggregator output
#   p2 = jet contrastive only (per-object contrastive weight 0)
# Seeds 42 424 4242 42424 (owner, 2026-11-26), two runs per card (SLOTS_PER_GPU=2).
# @mem below: the CPU estimate used at launch (experiments/dev/2026-11-26_cpu-mem-estimate); see CORRECTED.
# @est: seconds per epoch WHILE two share a card, upper bound = 2 x normal_RC's P1 alone on an A40 (6650 s);
#       40 epochs = 148 h of the 167.5 h a 7-day job leaves.
# Launched 2026-11-26 (stage P_small_RC_20261126_123135):
#   CONFIG=saint_small_RC MAX_EPOCHS=40 SEEDS="42 424 4242 42424" WALLTIME=7-00:00:00 EST_SECONDS_PER_EPOCH=13300 \
#   GPU_NODE=gpu-L40S-open,gpu-A40 STAGE=P_small_RC PACKS=3 SLOTS_PER_GPU=2 GPU_BUDGET_GIB=40 MEM_PER_GPU_GB=48 \
#   CELLS=experiments/2026-11_pretrain-saint-small/configs/P_small_RC.cells bash slurm/ssl_pack.sh
# CORRECTED 2026-11-26 23:15 in the stage's task_mem.tsv (read at every claim): the GPU peaks measured in the first
# epochs are P0 16.6, P1 22.5, P2 15.3 GiB, so @mem = 17 / 23 / 16 (never two P1 on a card).  The CPU estimate
# (12 / 19 / 14) let two P1 share a card: p1 seeds 424 and 4242 ran out of memory after 1 min and were re-queued
# (their folders kept as seed_<s>_OOM_20261126).
p0_small_RC  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping @est=13300 @mem=12
p1_small_RC  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping pretrain.loss_weights.jet_contrastive=1.0 @est=13300 @mem=19
p2_small_RC  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping pretrain.loss_weights.contrastive=0.0 pretrain.loss_weights.jet_contrastive=1.0 @est=13300 @mem=14
